{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51401","headline":"西山即事奉寄故园徐处士 · 施肩吾","name":"西山即事奉寄故园徐处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆作江西少施氏，君爲城北老徐翁。\n诗篇忆昔欢相接，颜貎如今恨不同。\n世界尽忧蔬上露，时人皆怕烛前风。\n唯余独慕神仙道，芥子虽穷寿不穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}